{"unit_id":"tag:09Y9:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）概形（scheme）。集合（sets）的可构造层（constructible sheaves）的范畴（category），是<MATH_0002>的全子范畴（full subcategory），由层（sheaves）<MATH_0003>组成，它们是余等化子（coequalizers）<MATH_0004>，使得<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>为有限（finite）余积（coproduct），由形如<MATH_0007>的层（sheaves）组成，其中<MATH_0008>为拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）对象（object），位于<MATH_0009>中。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"coequalizers","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"coproduct","target_term":"余积"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"coequalizers","target_term":"余等化子","context":"余等化子呈示。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"coproduct","target_term":"余积","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":